<Layout title="Privacy notice — draft pending legal review" description="Read the draft privacy information for VendBI website enquiries. Legal entity, privacy contact and retention details require confirmation before lead collection."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container reading-width"><p class="eyebrow">WEBSITE PRIVACY / DRAFT</p><h1>Your information.<br/>Handled with care.</h1><p>This notice is a draft. Lead collection must remain disabled until the responsible company, processors and privacy practices are confirmed.</p></div></section><article class="container reading-width article-body"><section><h2>Enquiry information</h2><p>When enabled, demo, contact and partner forms collect the details shown on the form, including name, company, contact information and operational requirements. These details are intended for responding to the enquiry and evaluating suitability. Do not submit passwords or confidential customer information.</p></section><section><h2>Delivery and abuse protection</h2><p>The configured lead-delivery provider receives enquiry details. Cloudflare Turnstile is used for abuse protection when forms are enabled. Its challenge service processes technical browser and network information. Confirm provider agreements and applicable transfers before enabling forms.</p></section><section><h2>Before collection can begin</h2><p>To be completed: legal company name and address, privacy contact, applicable legal basis, processor identities, hosting and transfer locations, retention period, deletion procedure, rights request process and regulator information where applicable.</p></section><section><h2>Analytics and cookies</h2><p>No advertising trackers or analytics scripts are included in this build. If introduced later, review notice and consent requirements first. The separately hosted management portal has its own data practices.</p></section></article></Layout>
